<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-NIYONGABO PULLS OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-NIYONGABO PULLS OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burundi's Olympic 5,000 metres champion Venuste Niyongabo has pulled out of the sixth world championships starting on Saturday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the International Amateur Athletic Federation said Niyongabo had been struggling recently with a leg injury.</p>
</text>
